hadiths[88]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4320","abn amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dnya myn ryshm why phnta hay js ka aakhrt myn kwyy hsh nhyn“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4321","hzyfh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn chandy ya swnay kay brtn myn khanay pynay ya ryshm awr brky pr phnnay ya bythnay say mna frmaya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4322","aly nay btaya kh khda kay rswl kw ayk dhary dar chadr pysh ky gyy js myn ryshm tha awr asay bhyja، lykn jb aly nay asay phna tw dykha kh wh ghsay myn hyn۔ as nay phr kha kh myn nay asay aap kay pas phnnay kay lyay nhyn bhyja tha blkh awrtwn kay lyay prdh krnay kay lyay bhyja tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4323","amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ryshm phnnay say mna frmaya swayay as hd kay، js ky trf rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apny drmyany awr shhadt ky angly atha kr an kay sath jwr dya tha۔ bkhary w mslm۔"
"4324","mslm ka ayk nskhh btata hay kh aljbyh (yrmwk kay mydan jng kay shmal myn bhyrh glyl kay mshrq myn ayk qsbh۔ amr yrwshlm kay zwal say phlay whan gyay thay۔) myn as nay apnay khtab myn kha kh khda kay rswl nay ryshm phnnay say mna kya hay swayay dw، tyn ya char anglywn kay۔"
"4325","asmaa bnt abwbkr rzy allh anh nay shahy farsy zban ka ayk chadr nkaly js myn brwkyd ka ghas tha awr aagay awr pychhay brwkyd say jra hwa tha، awr kha: yh khda kay rswl ky chadr thy jw aayshh rzy allh anha kay pas thy، jw mjhay an ky wfat kay wqt wrast myn mly thy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm asay phntay thay awr hm asay bymarwn kay lyay ghsl dytay thay awr as say shfaa ky kwshsh krtay thay۔ (js pany myn asay dhwya jata tha wh bymarwn kw pynay kay lyay dya jata tha، ya khwd an pr kpra dal dya jata tha، ya anhyn chhwnay ya chwmnay kay lyay dya jata tha awr as trh brkt hasl hwty hay) mslm nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4326","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay zbyr rzy allh anh awr abdalrhmn rzy allh anh kw laysns dya tha۔ awf kw kharsh ky wjh say ryshm phnna hay۔ (bkhary awr mslm۔) mslm kay ayk wrzhn myn anhwn nay kha kh anhwn nay kyray ky shkayt ky awr as nay anhyn ryshm ky qmyzyn phnnay ka laysns dya۔"
"4327","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ aas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn zafran say rngay hwyay dw kpray phnay hwyay dykha tw frmaya: yh wh kpray hyn jw kafr phntay hyn، anhyn mt phnw۔ ayk wrzhn khta hay kh jb as nay anhyn dhwnay ka mshwrh dya tw as nay jwab dya، \nhyn، anhyn jla dw۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4328","am slmh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw jw lbas sb say zyadh psnd tha wh ayk qmyz hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4329","asmaa bnt yzyd nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky qmyz ky aastyn klayy tk aagyy۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4330","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qmys phny tw aap dayyn trf say shrwa krtay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4331","abwsayd alkhdrl rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”mwmn ka nchla lbas phnnay ka tryqh yh hay kh wh as ky tangwn kay aadhay hsay say nychay hw، awr agr wh as kay awr tkhnwn kay drmyan aadhay rastay pr aajayay tw as pr kwyy gnah nhyn، lykn jw as say nychay aayay ga wh jhnm myn hay (tyn mrtbh yh khtay hwyay) kh allh taalyٰ as ky qyamt kay dn dwbarh as ky trf nhyn dykhay ga۔ tkbr say۔\ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4332","slym nay apnay wald ka yh asr nql kya hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jw shkhs tkbr kay sath ksy aysy chyz say pychhay htay js myn nchlay kpray، qmys awr pgry myn ltknay ky ajazt hw، allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as ky trf nhyn dykhay ga۔\"" asay abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4333","abw kbshh nay kha kh khda kay rswl kay ashab nay jw sr ka pwshak phna tha wh chpta tha۔ (yh wazh nhyn hay kh yhan mrad sr kay pwshak ky trf hay jw nychy awr chwry thy ya chwry aastyn ky trf۔ sabqh kw trjyh dy jaty hay۔ j۔ mrqat، iv، 424۔) trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh rwayt rd hay۔"
"4334","jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay nchlay kpray ka zkr kya tw am slmh rzy allh anha nay pwchha kh awrt kw kya krna chahyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay ayk mdt tk atar dyna chahyay۔ as nay jwab dya kh as swrt myn wh mkml twr pr nhyn dhanpay gy، awr as nay kha kh wh asay ayk hath nychay kr skty hay، lykn mzyd nhyn۔ asay malk، abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4335","trmzy awr nsayy kay nskhwn myn abn amr say mrwy hay kh anhwn nay kha kh phr an kay paon nngay hw jayyn gay، aap nay jwab dya kh asay ayk hath nychay kr dyn، lykn mzyd nhyn۔"
"4336","maawyh b۔ qrh nay apnay wald say nql kya hay kh: myn mzynh ky ayk jmaat kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya js nay aap say byat ky awr jb aap kay btn khlay tw myn nay apna hath aap ky qmyz kay andr dala awr mhr mhsws ky۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4337","smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sfyd kpray phnw، kywnkh wh zyadh pakyzh awr bhtr hyn awr apnay mrdwn kw an myn kfn dw۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4338","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay amamh bandha tw sr kw apnay kndhwn kay drmyan ltka dya۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4339","abdalrhmn by۔ awf nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as pr amamh bandha awr as kay sray as kay aagay awr pychhay ltkayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4340","rkanh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hm myn awr mshrkyn myn frq yh hay kh hm twpywn kay awpr amamh bandhtay hyn۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay js ky snd qabl aatbar nhyn hay۔"
"4341","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt ky awrtwn kay lyay swna awr ryshm hlal hay awr mrdwn kay lyay hram hay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"4342","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb kwyy nya lbas phntay tw as ka nam pgry، qmys ya chadr lytay awr phr khtay: aay allh tyry hmd hay، js trh tw nay mjhay phnaya hay، myn tjh say as ky bhlayy awr as ky bhlayy ka swal krta hwn js kay lyay yh bnaya gya tha، awr myn as kay shr say pnah mangta hwn awr as kay shr say pnah mangta hwn۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4343","maaz b۔ ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh agr kwyy khana khata hay awr phr khta hay kh allh ka shkr hay js nay mjhay yh khana khlaya awr myry trf say ksy taqt awr taqt kay bghyr mjhay dya tw as kay sabqh gnah maaf kr dyay jayyn gay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay، awr abwdaod nay mzyd kha hay kh agr kwyy lbas phn kr yh khay kh \alhmd llh js nay mjhay yh phnaya awr myry trf say ksy taqt awr taqt kay bghyr mjhay ata kya\"" tw as kay aglay awr pchhlay gnah maaf kr dyay jayyn gay۔"""
"4344","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: ”agr tm myray sath shaml hwna chahty hw، aayshh، tw dnya ky chyzwn pr swar kay rzq ky hd tk razy hw ja، amyrwn kay sath bythnay say ajtnab kr، awr jb tk kpray kw pywnd nh kr day asay prana nh smjhw“۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay kh yh ayk ghryb rwayt hay jsay wh srf salh bn ky rwayat myn say jantay thay۔ hsn js ky rwayat mhmd bn nay byan ky hyn۔ asmayl (yany bkhary) kw rd kya jayay۔"
"4345","abw amamh lyas bn salbh nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: snw، snw، pranay kpray phnna ayman ka hsh hay، pranay kpray phnna ayman ka hsh hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4346","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw as dnya myn bray kpray phnta hay allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn aajzanh lbas phnayay ga۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4347","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya، \jw ksy ky nql krta hay wh an myn say hay۔\"" asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4348","swyd b. whb nay khda kay rswl kay ayk shaby kay bytay ka hwalh dya js nay kha kh as kay wald nay khda kay rswl say rwayt ky hay kh: \jw shkhs khwbswrt lbas phnna chhwr dyta hay jb wh aysa kr skta hay (jysa kh ayk nskhh myn byan kya gya hay) khda ky trf say azt ka lbas phnaya jayay ga، awr jw shkhs khda kay lyay taj kay sath shady kray ga wh khda ky mrzy kay sath taj hwga.\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
"4349","trmzy nay lbas kay baray myn rwayt kw swyd kay akhtyar myn maaz bn ky snd say nql kya hay۔ ans۔"
"4350","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say btaya kh an kay dada nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \khda psnd krta hay kh as kay bnday pr as ky mhrbany ka nshan nzr aayay۔\"" (jn lwgwn kw khda nay trqy dy hay wh apnay mqam kay mtabq kpray phnyn، kywnkh ghryb lwg anhyn sdqh dynay kay qabl aadmy kay twr pr phchan sktay hyn۔ ahl alm kw apnay alm kw chhpa nhyn rkhna chahyay takh dwsray as say faydh atha skyn) asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""
"4351","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an ky ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay، awr ayk pragndh aadmy kw dykh kr js kay bal bay prdh thay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya as shkhs kw kwyy aysy chyz nhyn mly jw apnay balwn kw lyt kr lay؟ as nay ayk aadmy kw gnday kpray phnay hwyay dykha awr kha kya as aadmy kw apnay kpray dhwnay kay lyay kwyy chyz nhyn mly؟ asay ahmd awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4352","abwalahwas nay apnay wald say nql kya hay kh: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ghryb lbas phnay aaya awr aap nay mjh say pwchha kh kya myray pas kwyy jayydad hay؟ jb myn nay jwab dya kh myray pas hay tw as nay mjh say pwchha kh yh kwn sy qsm hay، tw myn nay kha: hr qsm، allh nay mjhay awnt، mwyshy، bhyr، ghwray awr ghlam ata kyay hyn۔ as nay phr kha kh jb khda tmhyn jayydad day tw as kay fzl awr azt ka nshan tm pr nzr aayay۔ asay ahmd awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ shrh alsn myn as ka lfz almsabyh hay۔"
"4353","abdallh by۔ amrw byan krtay hyn kh jb ayk aadmy dw srkh kpray phnay hwyay thay nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzray awr aap kw slam kya tw aap nay as kay slam ka jwab nhyn dya۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4354","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn jamny rng ky swary nhyn krta، nh zafran say rnga hwa lbas phnta hwn awr nh hy ryshm ky qmys phnta hwn۔ anhwn nay yh bhy kha kh ’’mrdwn kay astamal krdh prfywm myn khwshbw tw hwny chahyay lykn rng nhyn، awr khwatyn kay astamal krdh prfywm ka rng tw hwna chahyay lykn bdbw nhyn‘‘۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4355","abw ryhanh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ds chyzwn say mna frmaya: dantwn kay srwn kw tyz krna، gwdna، bal nwchna، mrd bghyr kpray kay akthay swna، awrtyn bghyr kpray kay akthay swna، mrd apnay kprwn kay nychay farsywn ky trh ryshm dalna، ya apnay kndhwn pr ryshm phnna، farsywn ky trh chhlka phnna، dstkht ky angwthyan، swayay ksy atharty kay maamlay myn۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4356","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay swnay ky angwthy ya qsy ka lbas phnnay ya kathy kay kpray astamal krnay say mna frmaya hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ abwdaod kay ayk nskhay myn anhwn nay kha kh anhwn nay jamny rng kay kpray say mna kya hay۔"
"4357","maawjy nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \ryshm kay saman ya pynthr ky khalwn pr swar nh hw\""۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4358","albraa b۔ aazb nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay srkh kprwn say mna frmaya hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4359","abw rmsh tymy khtay hyn kh jb myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay dw sbz kpray phnay hwyay thay، aap kay bal sfyd hw rhay thay، lykn srmyy srkh rng kay thay۔ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay۔ abwdaod kay ayk nskhay myn kha gya hay kh as kay pas mhndy say daghay hwyay talay thay (yh talay kanwn ky lw tk nychay ltktay thay)۔"
"4360","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bymar thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm asamh ky trf tyk lga kr bahr nklay، bayyn kndhay pr dhary dar kpray phnay، awr an ky amamt ky۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4361","aayshh nay kha؛ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay dw mwtay dhary dar kpray phn rkhay thay، jb aap bythtay awr psynh aatay tw aap anhyn bhary mhsws krtay۔ ayk yhwdy kay pas sham say kpray ky ayk khyp aayy tw myn nay mshwrh dya kh wh as kay pas bhyjay awr as say dw kpray khryday takh halat aasan hwnay pr ada kyay jayyn۔ as nay aysa hy kya، awr jb as shkhs nay jwab dya، \myn janta hwn kh tm kya chahtay hw، tm srf yh chahtay hw kh myra mal lay jao،\"" khda kay rswl nay kha، \""as nay jhwt bwla hay، wh janta hay kh myn an myn say sb say zyadh mtqy hwn awr amant pr dy janay waly chyzwn kw ada krnay ka aady hwn۔\"" asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4362","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ aas rzy allh anh khtay hyn: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay srkh pylay rng kay kpray phnay hwyay dykha awr pwchha kh yh kya hay، tw myn nay phchan lya kh wh kya napsnd krta hay، myn nay ja kr asay jla dya۔ as nay mjh say pwchha kh myn nay apnay kpray kay sath kya kya hay، jb myn nay asay btaya kh myn nay asay jla dya hay tw as nay kha: tm nay asay apnay ghr walwn myn say ksy kw phnnay kay lyay kywn nhyn dya، kywnkh awrtwn kay lyay as myn kwyy hrj nhyn؟ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4363","hlal by۔ aamr nay apnay wald ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha kh anhwn nay mnyٰ myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw khchr pr srkh chadr awrhay khtab krtay hwyay dykha awr an kay samnay aly rzy allh anh apny bat kw dhra rhay thay۔ (as ky wjh yh thy kh hjwm atna zyadh tha kh sb nby sly allh alyh wslm kw sn sktay thay۔‘‘ AIi apnay alfaz kw an lwgwn kay fayday kay lyay dhra rha tha jw khtab brdasht krnay say bht dwr thay) abwdaod nay asay nql kya۔"
"4364","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay ayk syah chadr bnwayy gyy thy awr aap nay asay phna dya، lykn jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as myn psynh aaya awr awn ky bdbw dykhy tw aap nay asay phynk dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4365","jabr nay kha؛ jb myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm apnay ghtnwn myn hath rkhay ayk chadr awrhay bythay thay js ky jhalr aap kay paon pr thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4366","dyhh by۔ khlyfh nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas amdh msry kpray kay kchh tkray layay gyay tw aap nay mjhay ayk dya awr frmaya: asay dw hswn myn tqsym kr dw، an myn say ayk kw qmys myn kat dw awr dwsra apny bywy kw dwpth kay lyay day dw۔ phr jb as nay mnh phyr lya tw aap nay frmaya: awr apny bywy kw hkm dw kh wh as kay nychay kpra phn lay awr apny shkl nh dkhayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4367","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an ky ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay jb wh prdh myn thyn awr frmaya: ayk thh astamal krw، dw nhyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4368","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzra tw myray nchlay kpray ka ayk hsh nychay ltka hwa tha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” abdallh، apna nchla kpra athao۔ myn nay aysa hy kya awr as nay asay awncha krnay kw kha۔ myn nay aysa hy kya، awr jb myn abhy bhy bhtryn jgh tlash krnay ky kwshsh kr rha tha kh [as kay lyay] lwgwn myn say ayk nay pwchha kh asay khan phnchna chahyay awr as nay jwab dya، \aadhy tangyn awpr۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4369","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as ky trf nhyn dykhay ga jw tkbr say apnay kpray kw pychhay kray ga۔ abwbkr rzy allh anh nay phr kha: aay allh kay rswl، myra nchla lbas as wqt tk ltka rhta hay jb tk kh myn as ky trf twjh nh krwn، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya، \aap an lwgwn myn say nhyn hyn jw tkbr krtay hyn۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
"4370","akrmh nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay abn abas rzy allh anhma kw nchly chadr awrhtay hwyay dykha kh samnay wala hym paon kay awpr gra awr asay pychhay athatay hwyay pwchha tw aap nay aysa kywn kya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw aysa krtay dykha hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4371","abadh nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \pgrywn kw apnay pas rkhw، kywnkh yh frshtwn ka nshan hyn، awr apny pyth kay pychhay ltka hwa hay.\"" byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"""
"4372","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb asmaa bnt abwbkr rzy allh anh baryk kpray phn kr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwyyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an say mnh phyr lya awr frmaya: ”jb awrt hyz aanay kay lyay bwrhy hw jayay tw yh drst nhyn kh as ka kwyy hsh nzr aayay mgr yh awr yh“۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4373","abw mtr nay byan kya hay kh aly nay tyn drhm myn ayk kpra khryda awr asay phna kr kha: allh ka shkr hay js nay mjhay aysay achhay kpray ata kyay hyn jn say myn mrdwn kay drmyan aarasth hw jaon awr apny brhngy kw dhanp skwn۔ as nay phr kha: myn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4374","abw amamh nay byan kya kh amr bn alkhtab nay ayk nya kpra phna awr kha: allh ka shkr hay js nay mjhay aysy chyz phnayy hay js say myry brhngy kw chhpanay awr myry zndgy myn khwd kw snwarnay kay lyay۔ as kay bad as nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay kh agr kwyy nya kpra phnta hay tw khta hay kh \khda ka shkr hay js nay mjhay aysy chyz phnayy hay js say myry brhngy kw dhanpnay awr myry zndgy myn apnay aap kw snwarnay kay lyay\"" tw wh prana kpra lay kr asay sdqh kay twr pr dyta hay، jb wh mrdh hw jayay ga tw wh khda ky hfazt، wlayt awr pnah myn hw ga۔ ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""
"4375","alqmh b۔ abw alqmh nay apny waldh say nql kya hay kh jb abd alrhmn ky byty hfsh aayshh rzy allh anha kay pas baryk chadr awrhay hwyay thyn tw aayshh rzy allh anha nay asay phar dya awr mwta prdh dal dya۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4376","abd alwahd by۔ aymn nay apnay wald ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha: myn aayshh rzy allh anha ky ayadt kay lyay gya tw anhwn nay qtry phn rkhy thy (ayk mwtay qsm ka mwad۔ nam kw ksy jgh say jwra jata hay، lykn as myn akhtlaf hay kh yh msr myn tha ya bhryn kay prws myn) js ky qymt panch drhm thy۔ as nay kha: myry lwndy ky trf ngah atha kr asay dykhw، kywnkh wh asay ghr myn phnnay pr fkhr krty hay، phr bhy myn nay rswl allh kay zmanay myn as qsm ky tbdyly ky thy، awr mdynh myn kwyy aysy awrt nhyn thy jsay zyb tn kya gya hw js nay asay adhar lynay kay lyay myray pas nh bhyja hw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4377","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh ayk dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aastyn wala gaon phnaya jw aap kw pysh kya gya tha، lykn jldy say asay atar kr amr rzy allh anh kay pas bhyj dya، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay ks rftar say atara tha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jbrayyl alyh alslam nay mjhay as say mna kya tha۔ phr amr rzy allh anh rwtay hwyay aayay awr kha: aay allh kay rswl، aap nay kwyy chyz napsndydh thy awr mjhay day dy، ab mjhay kya hwa؟ as nay jwab dya kh myn nay yh tmhyn phnnay kay lyay nhyn dya tha blkh myn nay tmhyn srf as lyay dya tha kh tm asay bychw۔ phr asay dw hzar drhm myn bych dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4378","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha kh yh srf ryshm ka bna hwa lbas hay js say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mna frmaya hay، lykn zyb w zynt awr tanay myn kwyy hrj nhyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4379","abwrajh nay kha: amran bn۔ hsyn rzy allh anh hmaray pas ryshm ka lbas zyb tn kyay hwyay bahr aayay awr aalan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya hay kh agr allh ksy pr ahsan krta hay tw wh psnd krta hay kh as kay bnday pr as ky mhrbany ka nshan nzr aayay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4380","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha: jw chahw khao awr jw chahw phnw jb tk kh dw chyzyn tm say chhwt jayyn: fzwl khrchy awr ghrwr۔ bkhary nay asay ayk bab kay anwan myn nql kya hay۔"
"4381","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh byan kya kh \khao، pyw، sdqh krw awr lbas phnw jb tk kh as kay sath fzwl khrchy awr ghrwr nh ml jayay۔\"" asay ahmd، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4382","hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny qbrwn awr msjdwn myn allh ky zyart kay lyay sb say bhtr chyz sfyd hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4383","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay swnay ky angwthy ly۔ ayk nskhh: khta hay kh as nay asay apnay dayyn hath pr rkha، phr asay phynk dya awr chandy myn say ayk lay lya js pr as nay kndh kya tha، \mhmd khda ka rswl،\"" yh khtay hwyay، \""myry as angwthy ky trh ksy kw kchh bhy nhyn kndh krna chahyay۔\"" jb as nay asay phna tw as nay pthr kw apny hthyly kay pas rkh dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4384","aly rzy allh anh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qsy awr zafran say rngy hwyy chyz phnnay، swnay ky angwthy astamal krnay awr kman bnatay wqt qraan ky tlawt say mna frmaya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4385","abdallh by۔ hzrt abas rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kay hath myn swnay ky angwthy dykhy tw aap nay asay khynch kr phynk dya awr kha kh tm myn say kwyy jhnm say kwylh bna kr apnay hath pr lga rha hay۔ khda kay rswl kay janay kay bad ksy nay as aadmy say kha، \apny dstkht ky angwthy lay lw awr as myn say kchh hasl krw\"" lykn as nay jwab dya، \""nhyn، myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh jb khda kay rswl nay asay phynk dya hay tw myn asay kbhy nhyn lwn ga۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4386","ans nay kha kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay fars kay shhnshah، bazntyny shhnshah awr njashywn kw kht lkhna chaha tw aap kw btaya gya kh wh mhr kay bghyr kht qbwl nhyn kryn gay۔ chnanchh khda kay rswl nay chandy ky angwthy ky shkl myn ayk mhr bnayy js pr as nay \mhmd khda ka rswl\"" kndh kya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ bkhary ka ayk nskhh khta hay kh mhr pr kndh kary tyn strwn myn thy، \""mhmd\"" ayk، \""rswl\"" dwsra awr \""khda ka\"" dwsra۔"""
"4387","anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky angwthy chandy ky thy awr pthr ky bhy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4388","as nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay apnay dayyn hath pr hbshy pthr kay sath chandy ky angwthy phny thy awr as ka pthr apnay hath ky hthyly kay pas rkha tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4389","as nay apnay bayyn hath ky chhwty angly ky trf asharh krtay hwyay kha، \as pr nby sly allh alyh wslm ky angwthy thy۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4390","aly nay drmyany angly awr as kay bad waly angly ky trf asharh krtay hwyay kha: \khda kay rswl nay mjhay apny as angly myn ya as pr angwthy phnnay say mna kya hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4391","abdallh by۔ jafr nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay dayyn hath myn angwthy phna krtay thay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4392","abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay aly rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4393","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay bayyn hath myn angwthy phna krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4394","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh ryshm lay kr apnay dahnay hath myn dala awr kchh swna lay kr bayyn hath myn rkha awr frmaya: yh myry amt kay mrdwn pr hram hyn۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4395","maawyh nay kha kh allh kay rswl nay pynthr ky khalwn pr swar hwnay awr swna phnnay say mna kya hay، swayay chhwtay tkrwn kay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4396","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy say jw pylay rng kay tanbay ky angwthy phnay hwyay thay، frmaya: myn tm myn btwn ky bw kysay dykhta hwn؟ tw as nay asay phynk dya awr lwhay ky angwthy phnay hwyay awr jb as nay kha kh myn tmhyn jhnmywn ky zynt myn kysa dykh rha hwn؟ as nay asay phynk dya awr khda kay rswl say pwchha kh wh kwn sa saman astamal kray؟ aap nay frmaya: chandy، lykn as ka wzn ayk msqal kay brabr nh hw۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ mhy alsn nay kha hay kh shl bn ky snd say shyh rwayt hay۔ sad rzy allh anh nay mhr kay baray myn kha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy say frmaya: \kchh tlash krw، agrchh wh lwhay ky angwthy hy kywn nh hw۔\"""""
"4397","abn msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ds chyzyn napsnd thyn: zrd rng، yany khlwq، sfyd balwn kw rngna، nchlay kpray kw pychhay krna، swnay ky angwthy phnna، awrt ka apnay aap kw aysay lwgwn kay samnay sjana jw mmnwah drjat myn nhyn hyn، nrd phynkna، daa krna، swayay qraan kay dw swrtwn kay۔ yhan jma ka astamal kya gya hay، awr yh tjwyz kya gya hay kh as myn khda kay nam ka astamal krtay hwyay kchh daayyn awr swrtyn shaml ky jayyn، tawyz phnna، mny kharj hwnay say phlay azw tnasl kw nkalna، awr dwdh planay waly awrt say jmaa krna۔ lykn as nay anhyn mmnwa qrar nhyn dya۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4398","abn zbyr nay byan kya kh an ky ayk khatwn gahk zbyr ky byty kw amr bn khtab kay pas lay gyy۔ alkhtab apny tang myn ghntyan bandhay hwyay hyn۔ amr nay anhyn kat dya awr kha kh myn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay kh hr ghnty kay sath ayk shytan hwta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4399","bnna، abdalrhmn bn ky khatwn mwkl۔ hyan alansary nay byan kya kh jb wh aayshh rzy allh anha kay pas thyn tw an kay pas ayk lrky layy gyy js myn ghnty bjy hwyy thy، as pr anhwn nay hkm dya kh jb tk wh as ky chhwty ghntyan nh kat dyn، wh asay andr nh layyn، kywnkh as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh frshtay as ghr myn dakhl nhyn hwtay js myn ghnty hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4400","abdalrhmn by۔ trafh nay btaya kh an kay dada arfjh by۔ asad js ky nak jng alklab myn kt gyy thy (yh hjrt say tqrybaً ds sal phlay ky lrayy thy js myn qbylh tmym shryk hwa tha) kw chandy ky nak lg gyy lykn as myn bdbw pyda hwgyy، tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay swnay ky nak lynay ka hkm dya۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4401","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy aag ky angwthy ksy kw phnana chahay tw asay swnay ky angwthy phnayay، agr kwyy aag ka har phnayay jsay wh psnd krta hay asay swnay ka har phnayay، awr agr kwyy aag ka kngn lgana chahay tw asay swnay ky angwthy phnayay awr asay chandy ka kra phnayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4402","asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw awrt swnay ka har phnty hay qyamt kay dn as kay glay myn asy trh ky aag daly jayay gy، awr jw awrt apnay kan myn swnay ky baly dalay gy، qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ as kay kan myn asy trh ky aag dalay ga۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4403","hzyfh ky ayk bhn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan kya kh tm awrtwn kay pas chandy ky aysy chyz hwty hay js say tm apnay aap kw snwartay hw، myn tmhyn yqyn dlata hwn kh tm myn say jw bhy awrt apnay aap kw swnay say aarasth kray gy asay as ky sza dy jayay gy۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4404","aqbh by۔ aamr nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay aap kw zyb w zynt awr ryshm phnnay walwn kw rwktay thay awr frmatay thay kh agr tm jnt ky zynt awr ryshm chahtay hw tw anhyn dnya myn mt phnw۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4405","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk angwthy thy، lykn jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay phna tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as nay mjhay tm say ghafl kr dya hay، aaj say myn asay dykh rha hwn awr tmhyn dykh rha hwn۔ as nay phr asay phynk dya۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4406","malk nay kha: mjhay yh napsnd hay kh nwjwanwn ka swnay ka lbas phna jayay، kywnkh myn nay sna hay kh khda kay rswl nay swnay ky angwthy phnnay say mna kya hay۔ awr myn asay mrd، bwrhay awr jwan dwnwn kay lyay napsnd krta hwn۔ as nay asay almwth myn mntql kya۔"
"4407","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw aysay jwtay phnay hwyay dykha js kay bal nhyn thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
